[{"title":"咏汉金釭","author":"刘文如","text":"赵家姊弟能音乐，大燕轻盈小燕啄。\n一朝选入汉宫来，君王宠爱生谣诼。\n昭仪绝幸住昭阳，彤朱髹漆百宝光。\n涎涎尾摇金屋里，玉阶铜沓木仓琅。\n壁带列钱在春殿，明珠翠羽如亲见。\n繁华铸出黄金釭，屈曲夔纹锁双燕。\n繁华千载尽成空，甘为绨封自绝宗。\n太息曹宫赫蹄药，椒香别殿怨东风。\n此釭小劫天所弃，千载沈埋在何地。\n拾得圆镮归我家，为检《汉书》证古器。\n团圞想见飞燕时，开匣摩挲手自持。\n温柔乡冷今何处，不若寒金可咏诗。\n女师我爱班家淑，辞辇归来守幽独。\n万载传流赋一篇，莫共伶元外传读。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27108,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题石室藏书图","author":"谢雪","text":"盥手披图看遗迹，图中石室神仙宅。\n卷轴参差叠六经，都是慈亲手所积。\n当日严亲游历时，慈亲彝训在书帷。\n自课四声通韵语，膝前把卷胜名师。\n敬睹遗容开泪目，依稀小榻依花木。\n秋庭新爽扇凉生，石室紬书随意读。\n幼学初资慈教成，壮学还因严训行。\n一品紫泥封诰后，圣人许说显亲名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27109,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"真子飞霜镜歌","author":"谢雪","text":"斋中金石雅堪咏，宝匣初开窥古镜。\n谁人铸出碧菱花，一片清光月同净。\n真子作镜名飞霜，背铸梧桐栖凤凰。\n真子一去不复返，造象依然镜里藏。\n琳琅修竹戛清影，几上剑光明耿耿。\n破土龙孙解箨时，残春正暖何尝冷。\n更有莲花出小池，珠盘翠盖走灵龟。\n灵龟腹下成虚纽，好让丝绦系更垂。\n镜背下方有池水，上方云气飘飘起。\n顾兔天光照水光，千年不改常如此。\n真子披衣坐竹林，却当初夏弄瑶琴。\n七弦一拂动风雨，晴来忽激清商音。\n倏尔长空变凉节，破晓霜华霏玉屑。\n翡翠楼前片片明，鸳鸯瓦上丝丝结。\n此时寒逼衣袂轻，月残霜落更虚明。\n青铜内有古人在，琴上无声如有声。\n此镜千年圆不缺，真子为谁疑未决。\n若是山阴道上人，一舟相访霜如雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27110,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题石室藏书图","author":"唐庆云","text":"选楼启匣爇香烟，共仰慈颜意黯然。\n今日华封真一品，当时庭训比三迁。\n半园花木归图内，万卷诗书在膝前。\n石室洞天皆福地，好将仙馆说琅{阝嬛}。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27111,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏汉金釭","author":"唐庆云","text":"玩此黄金釭，我怀感古昔。\n飞燕来赵家，姊妹并殊色。\n联翩入昭阳，同侍君王侧。\n昭仪宠更深，宫舍竞华饰。\n铜沓白玉阶，翠羽绿熊席。\n壁带为列钱，二等圜一尺。\n团圞似月明，中嵌蓝田璧。\n汉宫既为烬，耕夫破荆棘。\n得此一规铜，尚是西京迹。\n莫问仓琅门，春燕不相识。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27112,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"真子飞霜镜歌","author":"唐庆云","text":"我家金石罗文房，案头拂拭开缃囊。\n晓来启匣见古镜，青铜一片铭飞霜。\n略似菱花分八角，千年不蚀凝清光。\n背有古画老桐树，双枝并立栖凤凰。\n莲花绰约出小沼，神龟游上莲叶香。\n新笋破泥欲解箨，参差四面皆筼筜。\n山云轻聚衔半月，下有小几横干将。\n真子何人在竹下，膝前更见清琴张。\n仰观星月共皎洁，七弦乍弄神洋洋。\n仙人春夏坐晴暖，忽将雅操翻清商。\n一弹閒院有寒气，再弹更觉天苍凉。\n五更碧瓦一痕破，惊起青女窥鸳鸯。\n此时凉气满庭树，拂叶惨淡将成黄。\n阶前明月冷如水，霏霏玉屑沾衣裳。\n霜华拂拂看不定，冰蚕丝紧鸣指旁。\n我揽古鉴照双鬓，神清意静吟且长。\n云净遥天变春夏，每见夜色寒苍茫。\n真仙千载不知老，我且磨镜同诗藏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27113,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题石室藏书图","author":"刘蘩荣","text":"闻昔我祖姑，贞静本淑质。\n相夫兼教子，治家敦朴实。\n卓识明大谊，忠厚积隐德。\n克笃生吾亲，年已近三十。\n吾亲总角时，聪明即起特。\n作诗见清新，读书深有得。\n所以吾祖姑，爱亲尚柔克。\n严法孟母迁，勤效敬姜织。\n教亲穷经史，必当求绝识。\n教亲务圣学，不可听异术。\n教亲明世务，通达贵正直。\n教亲习礼仪，谦约尚谨饬。\n每当塾课归，亲即侍几侧。\n夙夜奉慈颜，动必循典则。\n书声四处闻，闇然居石室。\n嗟乎吾祖姑，乡闾本共式。\n披图神往之，能不忆当日。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27114,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和宋白玉蟾弹琴诗韵 其一","author":"阮恩滦","text":"湛然抱琴癖，閒弹送夕阳。\n云和不可作，一曲一回肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27115,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和宋白玉蟾弹琴诗韵 其二","author":"阮恩滦","text":"黯黯秋云里，森森修竹间。\n化机人不识，飞雁落空山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27116,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和宋白玉蟾弹琴诗韵 其三","author":"阮恩滦","text":"山月瞰长空，泠泠十指中。\n成连沧海上，千古叹高风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27117,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长芦庵","author":"阮恩滦","text":"大江茫茫江水白，堤畔筑庵护深碧。\n绯桃绿柳锁双眉，日浸波光荡云液。\n新芦簇簇满长洲，深厚由来畜土脉。\n彼苍眷注优且渥，四十年中地频辟。\n千村黛色接云容，百顷岚光被郊陌。\n江流浩浩汇奔注，两山排闼如相揖。\n昔年曾付丹青手，妙画难得云林笔。\n忽检巾箱旧图卷，痴翁豪素留名迹。\n烟江叠嶂渺千里，尺幅不嫌鹅绢窄。\n借作此图亦快事，风涛飒飒生虚壁。\n我今恍惚身入画，万壑千岩赴襟舄。\n弹琴一曲江月寒，苍翠空濛入帘隙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27118,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"选楼四时词 其一","author":"阮恩滦","text":"六幅蝉纱晓槛开，丝丝烟柳拂池台。\n佳辰又是清明近，罗幕低垂细雨来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27119,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"选楼四时词 其二","author":"阮恩滦","text":"金镜平开水一方，曲屏如幔石如床。\n月明风送荷香远，销得诗魂耐晚凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27120,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"选楼四时词 其三","author":"阮恩滦","text":"草凝寒露竹凝烟，水浅池塘堕白莲。\n雨过小林凉意足，满庭秋思雁来天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27121,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"选楼四时词 其四","author":"阮恩滦","text":"几日繁霜浅草枯，十三弦柱雁行孤。\n平林萧瑟栖残照，金背寒鸦接翅呼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27122,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"阮恩滦","text":"薰风夜透池荷飐，拂拂幽香来竹院。\n起视明星独倚阑，凉云密织鱼鳞片。\n冰绡雾縠却袢暑，披襟懒挈黄罗扇。\n镫疏月落不见人，隔花时有流萤现。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27123,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋日作","author":"阮恩滦","text":"水槛凉生雨脚微，青篱络角豆花肥。\n前宵已听新蛩语，不待梧桐一叶飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27124,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒月","author":"阮恩滦","text":"霜月照松涧，清辉特地寒。\n萝阴翠袖薄，心怯倚阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27125,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏琴墅梅","author":"阮恩滦","text":"茅屋藏花里，梅开满屋香。\n七弦鸣绿绮，千树绕红妆。\n古调凭谁契，冰姿为尔芳。\n泠泠惊宿鸟，月冻半林霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27126,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春望","author":"阮恩滦","text":"高楼眺平楚，江树何沈沈。\n茅屋互鳞比，烟霭一以深。\n青骢识归路，黄鹂弄好音。\n朅来写怀抱，举目悲登临。\n蘅芜渺天末，桃李乱云浔。\n韶华易逝羽，奄忽不可寻。\n俯仰感今昔，悠悠千古心。\n回首妆台畔，花落罥瑶琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27127,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"始闻蝉声","author":"阮恩滦","text":"日午风暄次第鸣，翛然一碧树无情。\n好音为报黄梅出，雅奏疑翻白苎轻。\n弄舌我怜才语涩，上头人爱鬓丝青。\n莫矜倚托清高甚，应悔秋来玉露零。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27128,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"阮恩滦","text":"柳阴深处觅新凉，百顷玻璃澹夕阳。\n閒把渔竿自垂钓，白莲花底起鸳鸯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27129,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉玲珑阁暴雨","author":"阮恩滦","text":"云压长空势欲摧，天教澄墨画图开。\n翻风乱飐竹阴碎，卷地忽闻荷气来。\n定有蛟龙迁窟宅，暗惊镫火暝楼台。\n秋声已在芭蕉树，不觉纱屏梦屡催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27130,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早凉","author":"阮恩滦","text":"鹊渚西风大火流，青虫扑簌夜釭幽。\n不知庭外凉多少，一树梧桐一叶秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27131,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋感怀","author":"阮恩滦","text":"雨馀人意爽，秋气足庭除。\n水曲闻蝉后，霜关警雁初。\n风欺袖罗薄，月瞰屋梁虚。\n渺渺沧江路，谁传双鲤书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27132,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奴自维扬载菊一舟藉传家乡风景绘有秋江载菊图故梦中云云因足成之","author":"阮恩滦","text":"家园回首费思量，城郭依依认绿杨。\n琴客弦诗宜水调，花奴载菊自江乡。\n柴桑粉本秋容澹，瓜步钟声驿路长。\n梦醒不知窗月皎，白云何处倍神伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27133,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兵乱未息乡问久疏南望白云形神交瘁人言愁始欲愁矣率赋长歌用摅忧抱","author":"阮恩滦","text":"羽檄半天下，江南复江北。\n千里望白云，可望不可即。\n忆昔在室时，帟帏侍晨夕。\n胜衣授文史，章句勤记述。\n馀事及绘画，丹青恣涂泽。\n如何一挥手，鹒蟀顿代易。\n巾车愿言迈，旋归那可得。\n岂伊冈阜高，伏莽多蝥贼。\n岂伊风涛阻，旌旗蔽江黑。\n端忧从中来，寤寐空反侧。\n深渊有蛟虬，丛薄饶豺貘。\n音书亦已渺，何况见颜色。\n日月如转毂，烽火何时熄。\n欲取瑶琴弹，思归操谁识。\n欲引浊醪饮，愁病输酒力。\n区区寸草心，胡以酬爱日。\n安得扫欃枪，尘氛清四极。\n上贺风云通，下庆乱离息。\n载咏《河广》诗，长风送归楫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27134,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮春晚晴","author":"阮恩滦","text":"西湖暮春天，连绵雨不歇。\n草色浓如烟，柳丝重欲折。\n今兹睹新晴，寻芳闹蜂蝶。\n归云意迟迟，斜阳半明灭。\n倚槛澹忘言，悠然自怡悦。\n晚花散馀香，帘卷一钩月。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27135,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春柳","author":"阮恩滦","text":"倦柳依依舞细腰，风丝轻拂鸟声娇。\n千门社鼓斜阳陌，一路酒旗红板桥。\n客梦远随流水去，春痕閒逐落花飘。\n是谁借与并州剪，剪出离愁万万条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27136,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和白香山月夜调琴忆崔少卿诗","author":"阮恩滦","text":"琴韵幽閒寄性情，香山月夜忆崔卿。\n可怜古调无知己，等作寻常箫管声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27137,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄家书","author":"阮恩滦","text":"拈毫欲写几迟回，万种新愁顷刻来。\n书尽兰笺心未尽，却教缄罢又重开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27138,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉吾母来札喜志","author":"阮恩滦","text":"画楼寂寞正徘徊，惊报家书一纸来。\n半是欢欣半还惧，先看函面莫轻开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27139,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶作","author":"阮恩滦","text":"片月衔山远，归云傍树横。\n江城吹玉笛，日夜故园情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27140,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日偶成","author":"阮恩滦","text":"平安两字托鱼笺，回首萱闱倍黯然。\n怕向高楼卷帘望，青山遮断白云天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27141,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"接家书有感 其一","author":"阮恩滦","text":"东风又到短长亭，惆怅珠湖柳色青。\n安得蒲帆悬十幅，随潮直下广陵城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27142,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"接家书有感 其二","author":"阮恩滦","text":"红桥回首路茫茫，雁足书来每断肠。\n惟愿烽烟渐平息，归篷影里白蘋香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27143,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和竹斋主人","author":"阮恩滦","text":"娇莺啼上绿杨枝，閒傍妆台瘦不支。\n半榻诗书常乱叠，一楼风雨最相思。\n瑶琴空抚思归操，黄绢慵赓绝妙词。\n鸿雁在云鱼在水，更谁传讯到天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27144,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初春游云楼","author":"阮恩滦","text":"笋舆破晓到云栖，万个琅玕夹道齐。\n笕路曲盘山磴窄，松阴深锁寺楼低。\n疏钟顿令尘心远，古壁应无俗客题。\n却喜寻春来较早，杏花微雨故凄迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27145,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云栖题壁和先文达公韵","author":"阮恩滦","text":"四山滴寒翠，长松夹修篁。\n江潮齧岸急，天风吹衣凉。\n咨禅参举叶，礼佛来焚香。\n定禽寂无语，云间钟梵长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27146,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由云栖纡道至湖上名园古寺游赏竟日泚笔赋之","author":"阮恩滦","text":"两载湖山住，题襟愿未酬。\n说曾闻约略，地始足句留。\n棠树垂先泽，花城饱艳游。\n剪镫劳梦忆，烟柳六桥头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27147,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日感怀","author":"阮恩滦","text":"独有思亲泪，逢春洒更多。\n两年经别久，千里奈愁何。\n画阁迟迟日，珠湖渺渺波。\n归期休复问，一岁一蹉跎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27148,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"王照圆","text":"何处清香远，遥瞻岭上梅。\n不随群卉茂，独占一阳开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27149,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"迎春花","author":"王照圆","text":"顿觉阳和至，迎春早吐花。\n风来舒绿叶，律转斗黄葩。\n冻蝶惊新梦，寒蜂出旧衙。\n预知天地意，逐暖露光华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27150,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"簪迎春花","author":"王照圆","text":"灰飞新节至，小苑发春花。\n迎暖分金蕊，横钗映鬓斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27151,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春柳","author":"王照圆","text":"时回春日暖，晴看柳垂金。\n绿叶和风放，新枝拂晓禽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27152,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过西海子看新荷","author":"王照圆","text":"凉亭水榭映朝霞，碧沼初开菡萏花。\n海子西头杨柳岸，绿烟深处是仙家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27153,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题阮太师母石室藏书小照","author":"王照圆","text":"《籑诂》研经万卷收，嫏嬛仙馆翠烟浮。\n斋名积古从公定，室有藏书是母留。\n俭素时妆无一点，丹青小照足千秋。\n应知淡月疏桐夜，缅想音容在选楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27154,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄三弟妇杨恭人都中","author":"方寿","text":"米贵长安居大难，相思愁见月团团。\n贫无锥地眉常展，旦戒仙郎漏正阑。\n井臼操持钦德曜，文章声价属都官。\n谁知粉署含香侣，依旧盐荠十载寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27155,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思亲","author":"方寿","text":"秋窗点滴两连绵，也似思亲泪未乾。\n一夜蕉梧声断续，教人辗转不成眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27156,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海棠花","author":"方寿","text":"含烟泫露小楼东，脉脉无言媚晚风。\n好似沈香亭畔醉，阑干十二倚娇红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27157,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪霁","author":"方寿","text":"快雪初晴月乍明，碧天无际透疏棂。\n香生薝卜心如水，閒展《黄庭》一卷经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27158,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂兴同蕙孙沈姊作","author":"尤澹仙","text":"微雨溪上来，斜阳澹茅屋。\n平原一以眺，良苗霭如沐。\n鸠鸣杏花红，村暗榆阴绿。\n野老善识时，相勉还相祝。\n膏润贵及时，秋稔已可卜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27159,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春夜喜山人送梅","author":"尤澹仙","text":"寒林漠漠春无影，款扉有客来铜井。\n折得梅花远寄将，一枝犹带溪云冷。\n我亦罗浮谪下仙，相逢此夕岂徒然。\n狂呼明月伴我饮，世人那识三婵娟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27160,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"尤澹仙","text":"玩月憩池塘，独把瑶琴弄。\n清风漾荷珠，打破鸳鸯梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27161,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦母","author":"尤澹仙","text":"肠断慈亲却早违，伶仃弱质痛何依。\n那堪梦里相逢处，犹道儿寒合著衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27162,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼夫子","author":"王绮","text":"挑镫独写奠夫文，绣阁沈沈闇闭门。\n一字一珠一点泪，九原君定有知闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27163,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铜雀台","author":"卢碧筠","text":"城头落日鸟声哀，漳水无情滚滚来。\n昔日繁华成幻梦，至今词赋想清才。\n空馀片瓦埋秋草，无复歌声吊夜台。\n遗冢纷纷竟何用，荒陵寒雨长蒿莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27164,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜绩课儿作","author":"陈勤","text":"丝丝缫不断，似我泪珠长。\n松静传虚籁，镫孤作细光。\n衔环非望报，画荻自堪伤。\n络纬闻深夜，同兹苦织忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27165,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日幽居","author":"陈勤","text":"叶尽秋深候，西风扫屋尘。\n鸟饥空啄树，蛩冷渐依人。\n梦早消江汉，贫常算米薪。\n敝裙聊自补，累岁御冬频。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27166,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"腊日书怀","author":"陈勤","text":"门户频年强自支，孤儿长大忆当时。\n敢言母教能如父，肯为家贫废就师。\n事业已空馀手泽，诗书不误有人知。\n天寒欲雪乌犹噪，唤子宵归共一枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27167,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"媚香楼歌","author":"孙云凤","text":"秦淮烟月板桥春，宿粉残脂腻水滨。\n翠黛红裙竞妆裹，垂杨句惹看花人。\n香君生长貌无双，新筑红楼唤媚香。\n春影乱时花弄月，风帘开处燕归梁。\n盈盈十五春无主，阿母偏怜小儿女。\n弄玉虽居引凤台，萧郎未遇吹箫侣。\n公子侯生求燕好，输金欲买红儿笑。\n桃花春水引渔人，门前系住游仙棹。\n奄党纤儿相纳交，缠头故遣狡童招。\n那知西子含颦拒，更比东林结社高。\n楼中刚耀双星色，无奈风波生顷刻。\n易服悲离阿软行，重房难把台卿匿。\n天涯从此别情浓，锦字书凭若个通。\n桐树已曾栖彩凤，绣帏争肯放游蜂。\n因愁久已抛歌扇，教坊忽报君王选。\n啼眉拥髻下妆楼，从今风月凭谁管。\n柘枝旧谱唱当筵，部曲新翻《燕子笺》。\n总为圣情怜腼觍，桃花宫扇赐帘前。\n天子不知征战苦，风前且击催花鼓。\n阿监潜传铁锁开，美人犹在琼台舞。\n银箭声残火尚温，君王匹马出宫门。\n西陵空自宫人泣，南内谁招帝子魂。\n最是秦淮古渡头，伤心无复媚香楼。\n可怜一片清溪水，犹向门前呜唈流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27168,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]